sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant TicketSys as Ticket System
    participant Triage as Triage Agent
    participant CRM
    participant Tech as Technical Agent
    participant Billing as Billing Agent
    participant KB as KB Agent
    participant Routing as Routing Agent
    participant Destination

    Customer->>TicketSys: Submit support ticket
    TicketSys->>Triage: New ticket received
    activate Triage

    Triage->>CRM: Lookup customer profile
    activate CRM
    CRM-->>Triage: Customer tier, history
    deactivate CRM

    Note over Triage: Categorize issue<br/>Set SLA deadline

    Triage->>Tech: Analyze if technical issue
    Triage->>Billing: Analyze if billing issue
    Triage->>KB: Search knowledge base

    par Parallel Analysis
        activate Tech
        Tech->>Tech: Review error logs<br/>Check API docs
        and
        activate Billing
        Billing->>Billing: Check payment records<br/>Verify subscriptions
        and
        activate KB
        KB->>KB: Search similar issues<br/>Calculate confidence
    end

    Tech-->>Routing: Technical analysis result
    deactivate Tech
    Billing-->>Routing: Billing analysis result
    deactivate Billing
    KB-->>Routing: KB match + confidence
    deactivate KB
    deactivate Triage

    activate Routing
    Note over Routing: Decision Logic:<br/>- KB confidence > 80%?<br/>- Urgency level?<br/>- Customer tier?

    alt High KB Confidence (>80%)
        Routing->>Destination: Auto-response with solution
        Note over Destination: Send FAQ/Solution<br/>~40% of tickets
    else Urgent/Enterprise
        Routing->>Destination: Escalate to manager
        Note over Destination: Create incident<br/>~5% of tickets
    else Default
        Routing->>Destination: Route to human team
        Note over Destination: L1/L2 Support<br/>~55% of tickets
    end

    deactivate Routing
    Destination-->>Customer: Ticket acknowledged
    TicketSys->>TicketSys: Background SLA Monitor<br/>Escalate if time running out

    Note over TicketSys: Continuous monitoring<br/>for SLA compliance
